// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Crimson Revenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2407169152" "Crimson Revenant"
// ProfessionString :
"P730542110" "Hero Hunter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3396524673" "Crimson Revenant is a professional hero hunter. He's made a pretty penny taking on jobs for Arachnos, and so he's content to outsource some of his tasks to other villains for a cut of the action. For someone who's spent the better part of his adult life cutting down heroes in their prime, Crimson Revenant has a pretty sunny outlook on life. Just don't cross him. The clouds can roll in fast."
// HelloString :
"P3441196790" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Well, well, if it isn't {VillainName}!</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3151329365" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Howdy, {VillainName}! How's tricks?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P481262958" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You looking for something to do?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P731670324" "Sorry, buddy, we haven't met. You should be talking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P709397370" "So, you're {VillainName}, huh? I've been hearing quite a bit about you lately. Luckily, no one's hired me to take you down. Yet. So we can work together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4109665840" "I've got no more jobs for you, {VillainName}. Ask someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1585326804" "You're overbooked as it is."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3450588384" "I've got a job, but it's a little rough for someone below Threat Level {Level}."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P630787931" "I'm a hero hunter, got it? Hero hunter. I'm not going to work with anyone who hasn't proven he's got what it takes to take down a hero. There's a ghost on Sharkhead Isle, the ghost of Scrapyard. Take it down, and I'll know you've got the guts to handle my tasks."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P856364347" ""
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1308033788" "I think things are getting friendlier between us. Maybe I can trust you with some tougher tasks. If you need some better <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> to keep you in top shape, I can help you out. Take my number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2046909184" "You've earned my trust ten times over, {VillainName}. It's time for us to take on some serious cases. You'll need the very best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>equipment.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4207072000" "I've got no jobs that would interest you."
// LocationString :
"P2093761884" "Nerva Archipelago"
// IntroString :
"P4236901626" "You should meet Crimson Revenant. He's a weird guy, but he can get you high paying jobs taking out big time heroes. He can line your pockets while beefing up your rep. He can get you Technology and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1245000338" "Choose Crimson Revenant"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1616738787" "Crimson Revenant seems like a softy. But he's put a number of the world's toughest heroes away. Permanently."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1176148803" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I know who could help you out."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3877669463" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know might be able to help you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


