// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Psimon Omega 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P950281314" "Psimon Omega"
// ProfessionString :
"P1600213744" "Psychic Mastermind"
// DescriptionString :
"P979586608" "Psimon Omega is an intimidating sort. He is a tall, strong man with a stare which looks right through you. It's said that he is a master psychic, capable of reading minds and seeing into the future. It's also said that he seeks to destroy any opposition to his psychic mastery."
// HelloString :
"P3098536180" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have foreseen your coming.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P746968828" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I know what's on your mind.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3282926297" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My psychic sense is tingling.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2375550322" "We've met, but not at this point in time. I sense Darla Mavis may have work for you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3165718441" "I am Psimon Omega, and I am a master psychic. The secrets of the mind are open to me, and I have delved deeply. Others seek to usurp my place of power, and I must act to preserve it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4239393993" "I sense no further need for you. Go now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3792071930" "You mind is cluttered with other matters. Resolve them before returning to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P588246840" "You are not ready for the tasks I have for you. Come back when you are Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P827914624" "You have proven yourself most resourceful. But you'll need more than wits and guts to make it on Nerva; You'll need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Take my private number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1941793916" "You are a worthy ally, {VillainName}. You should have the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P295349377" "The mastery of your own abilities continues. Our paths shall not cross again."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3880087160" "Get your sorry self out of my face. Go talk to Psimon Omega if you want an introduction. Word is that he's a master psychic who can read minds. In any case, he's looking for someone who can help with his agenda - whatever that is. I sincerely hope it leads you to your doom. Psimon's got Mutant and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2403748680" "Choose Psimon Omega"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3446975263" "Psimon can be a bit arrogant, but as long as you don't cross him he won't melt your mind!"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2111420704" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who will interest you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


