// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Timothy Raymond 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1935618015" "Timothy Raymond"
// ProfessionString :
"P3315241082" "Ex Lost"
// DescriptionString :
"P3418800548" "Timothy Raymond could have been a hero. His latent psionic abilities, under the proper tutelage, could have developed into truly phenomenal powers. Sadly, that wasn't in the cards for Timothy. Instead of attracting the attention of Paragon City's heroes, his abilities attracted the attention of the Lost. He was recruited into their ranks, where he remained for nearly a year while his body and mind underwent drastic changes due to continuous use of the mutagenic drug, Shift. His mental power eventually enabled Timothy to free himself, but not without permanent damage to his psyche. Arachnos likes to keep him around because they suspect that Rikti secrets lurk deep within his troubled mind. Whether that's true or not remains to be seen."
// HelloString :
"P2637637386" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>{VillainName}: Welcome.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3641644685" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You have much to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2203720404" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Our destiny awaits us.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2335807845" "We are strangers, you and I. Suggestion: seek the one in the shadows. If he trusts you, I will too."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1682427900" "{VillainName}: at last. You have haunted my dreams for some time, and now you are here in the flesh. This moment: doubt, excitement, terror. I know we will bring one another closer to our destinies. But I do not know whether those destinies are happy or forlorn."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3747740229" "Our paths no longer converge."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P157798091" "{VillainName}: overburdened. Advice: complete tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4163832292" "I need some help, but I think we should wait until you hit Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P561829820" "My trust in you increases. {VillainName} becomes: truest friend. Please accept: <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>all I can offer.</a> Please call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P484487007" "You and I: simpatico. Never forget this. I would love to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>help</a> you further."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4164048918" "For you: no tasks. Seek another."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P367270874" "There's a fellow on Nerva named Timothy Raymond. He's a weird one. Former member of the Lost, current pet freak of Arachnos. He'll get you the goods on the Rikti if that's who you're after. Timothy can get you Science and Mutant Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2080039395" "Choose Timothy Raymond"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4058360611" "Timothy's a strange guy. If you can understand him, he can take you to some interesting places."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3141631654" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Acquaintance</a> requests: introduction."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P387624947" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Acquaintances</a> request: introduction."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

